    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_7",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Joseph Jacob \"Joe\" Foss (April 17, 1915 – January 1, 2003) was a United States Marine Corps major and the leading Marine fighter ace in World War II. He received the Medal of Honor in recognition of his role in air combat during the Guadalcanal Campaign.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "value": 0.9999999968812954,
